# The builder stage does `COPY . /src`, so anything in the context invalidates the
# sbt layer -- a ~25 minute rebuild. Exclude paths the build never reads, so editing
# a workflow or a doc does not force a full recompile.
#
# NB: .git is deliberately NOT excluded. sbt-dynver derives the version from git
# tags, and without it the distribution would be stamped 0.1.0-SNAPSHOT.
.github/
ci/
*.md
!README.md

# Local build output, if the context is a working tree that has been built.
target/
*/target/
**/target/
.bsp/
.idea/
.metals/
.bloop/
